type: software
title: "ncsim: A Lightweight Simulator for Networked Edge Computing with Wireless Interference Modeling"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight discrete-event simulator for DAG scheduling over heterogeneous
  networked systems with multi-hop routing and realistic Wi-Fi interference
  modeling.
